prompt_text:
Look for Document number (typically an identifier formatted as DIR followed by numbers) anywhere in the document.
If not found, return: No Trace
✅ Respond ONLY with this exact JSON format:

{
"response": "<your extracted text here>"
}

FMEA number has following format <FEMA Sys-XXX> and ignore other values in FMEA number
expected output:

{

  "Total RAs": <Total retrieved RA entries count>,

  "Records": [

    {

      "S.No": "1",

      "RA_Number": "<exact RA value>",

      "Status": "<exact Risk Evaluation value>",

      "FMEA_Numbers": "<exact FMEA value>"
	}
	]
}
 Strict rules
Don't create your own text just extract what meta data contains
extract only from Risk Assessment and control table.

